    <section class="d-none card"><div class="card-body">
The results of the Newcomer Jack&Jill prelim during Bristol Swing Fiesta 2026 in  United Kingdom at 08/28/2026.<br />
<br />
Judges in this round were Peter Fradley, Audrey Disnard, Aleix Figueras, Peter Fradley, Orhiane Dang, Julia Leonard, Ryan Wrench-Buck, Fran Vidal, Henry Leonard, Max Wakeham, Susan Minor and Chloe Winzar.    </div></section>

